  "stageId": "main_04-07",
  "title": "Mutual Benefits",
  "storyCode": "4-7",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a4d8bf440fa083cab3cb3ca6ad0fbbab04337c467331ec608bc5d479ea362d4e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "This place... is filled with fallen Reunion."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...The blood from his wounds had been frozen, but his other body parts remained intact."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "This is Frostleaf's technique."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...Those ruins over there look like they were caused by explosives."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "It's probably Meteorite's work."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "(Frostleaf... Jessica... Meteorite... I'm sure they're still alive...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Amiya, all the rescue squads have reached Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We've extracted all the recon squads except for Meteorite's."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No Operators were lost on this mission, but..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Everyone suffered frostbite with varying degrees of severity."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You must take note of this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...Frostbite?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "All our recon squads observed a special group of Reunion troops wandering around the city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Unlike the reckless Reunion soldiers we're used to fighting, these members had a special way of fighting."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Be cautious."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I.... I understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, am I clear?"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "I understand.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Very well then."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I also have some things to do."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Amiya, even if Dr. {@nickname} is very helpful, you can't rely too much on a single person."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Also, mind the rings."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I know."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit actually worries about you a lot."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Before we realized it..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Dangerous beasts have bared their fangs."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Reunion is bearing down upon us.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Our retreat has been cut off...",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "These thugs really have it out for us.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Mm... They will do everything they can to keep us from getting away."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "But, we didn't come here to run away."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Rhodes Island will break through their ranks."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "We're going to rescue Meteorite's squad!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Projekt Red, do you copy?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Ahh, yes."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "That's right. I'll meet you at the slums' east entrance."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Mhm. It'll just be the two of us."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "We'll be fine."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Just the two of us are more than enough to fight against Reunion."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
